        "QUANTITATIVE RESEARCH METHODS",
        "These methods help you measure and count things, providing statistical evidence.",
        "1. SURVEYS / QUESTIONNAIRES",
        "What it is:",
        "Structured set of questions sent to large number of users to gather measurable data.",
        "How to conduct:",
        "Design clear, specific questions",
