        "Example 3:",
        "Problem: Farmers don't know when to harvest crops",
        "HMW: How might we provide farmers with timely harvesting information?",
        "Example 4:",
        "Problem: Parents struggle to find healthy snacks kids will eat",
        "HMW: How might we make healthy snacks appealing to children?",
        "How to Create Good HMW Questions",
        "Step 1: Start with User Insights",
